Package: taxaudit
Type: Package
Title: Taxonomic Audit, Character Ontology, and Pairwise Diagnosability
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person(given = "Aamna",
                family = "Naveed",
                role = c("aut", "cre"),
                email = "naamna588@gmail.com")
Description: Automates the extraction of morphological traits and taxonomic 
    literature auditing from unstructured botanical treatments. Implements 
    controlled ontology mapping, regular expression-based quantitative dimension 
    parsing, benchmark corpus management, and comparative baseline evaluation 
    protocols for biodiversity informatics.
